  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakafua; Bena Isalele bonso bakadisangisha, bakamujinga, bakamujika mu nsubu wandi mu Lama. Davidi wakajuka, wakaya biandi mu tshihela tshia Palana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wa mu Maona wakadiku wakadi ne bintu biandi ku mukuna wa Kâmele; wakadi muntu munene, wakadi ne mikoko binunu bisatu ne mbushi tshinunu; yeye wakadi ukosa miosa ya mikoko yandi mu Kâmele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dina dia muntu eu diakadi Nabala; dina dia mukashi wandi Abigayila; mukashi eu wakadi muena meji, wakadi ne mpala mulengele; kadi mulume wandi wakadi muena lukinu, wakadi ne bienzedi bibi; wakadi wa mu tshiota tshia Kaleba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakunyua lumu mu tshihela ne, Nabala udi ukosa miosa ya mikoko yandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakasungula bansongalume bandi dikumi, wakabatuma kudi Nabala mu Kâmele ne, Yai, numuambike muoyo mu dina dianyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "numuambile nunku, yeye udi ushikama mu bubanji, ne, Ditalala dikale kûdi ne kudi bonso ba mu nsubu webe ne kudi bintu bionso biudi nʼabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakunvua lumu ne, Wewe udi ukosa miosa ya mikoko; balami bebe ba mikoko bakadi nʼetu, tuetu katuakabenzela bibi, kabakamba tshintu tshimue musangu wonso wakadibo mu Kâmele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Webeshe bansongalume bebe, bobo nebakuambile; witabushe bansongalume aba basangane luse ku mesu kuebe; bualu bua tuetu tuakulua mu dituku dilengele; nunku ndi nkusengelela ne, Uhe bantu bebe ne muanʼebe Davidi tshionso tshidi mu tshianza tshiebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafika bansongalume ba Davidi kudi Nabala, bakamuambila mei au mu dina dia Davidi, bakahuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabala wakakudimuna bantu ba Davidi dî ne, Davidi udi nganyi? Muana wa Yishai udi nganyi? Bahika ba bungi badi batombokela bakelenge babo matuku â. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nengangate bidia bianyi ne mai anyi ne munyinyi wanyi unakashihela bakoshi banyi ba miosa ya mikoko bua kubifila kudi bantu bandi tshiyi mumanye kuakafumabo, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bantu ba Davidi bakalukila, bakahingana kudi Davidi, bakamuambila mei â onso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakambila bantu bandi ne, Suikai mikaba, muntu ne muntu muele wandi. Bakasuika mikaba, muntu ne muntu muele wandi; Davidi wakasuika mukaba kabidi ne muele wandi; bantu nkama inai bakalonda Davidi ne bantu nkama ibidi bakashala ha bintu biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umue wa bansongalume wakamanyisha Abigayila, mukashi wa Nabala, ne, Davidi wakatuma bantu ku tshihela bua kuelabo mukelenge wetu muoyo; yeye wakabatandisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bantu aba bakatuenzela bimpe, kabakatufuisha bundu, kabakatujimishila nansha tshintu tshimue, musangu utuakuenda nʼabo, hatuakadi mu madimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo bakadi bu lumbu kutudi butuku ne munya tô matuku onso atuakadi nʼabo balame mikoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku umanye bualu ebu, welangane meji a bualu bûdi musue kuenza; bualu bubi bulualua kudi mukelenge wetu ne kudi bonso ba mu nsubu wandi; bualu bua yeye udi muntu mulembakana, kakuena muntu udi mumanye mua kuakula nʼandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Abigayila wakaya lubilu, wakangata mitanda ya bidia nkama ibidi ne milondo ya nvinyo ibidi ne mikoko itanu yakadi milamba ne bihiminu bia blé mikanga bitanu ne bisumbu bia tumuma tukese tume lukama lumue ne bisumbu bia nfigi nkama ibidi: wakabiteka ha nyima ha nyama ya mpunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakambila bansongalume bandi ne, Nudianjile ku mpala kuanyi, monai, meme nennulonde. Yeye kakambila bayandi Nabala bualu ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakadi wenda ha nyima ha nyama wandi wa mpunda; hakadiye uhueka mu tshibanda, Davidi ne bantu bandi bakadi balue kudiye mu nshila bakasangakana nʼandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakadi wamba munda ne. Bulelela, nakalama bintu bia muntu eu mu tshihela tshianana, nansha tshintu tshiandi tshimue tshiakajimina; ne yeye wakushintakasha bubi ku buimpe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi atambe kuela bena lukuna ba Davidi mulau binashila muntu au muana mulume umue wa bintu bionso bidiye nʼabi tô ne muatshiabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatangila Abigayila Davidi, yeye wakatuluka ha nyima ha nyama wandi wa mpunda lubilu, wakatua mpala wandi hanshi ku mesu kua Davidi, wakamukukuila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakahona ku makasa andi, wakamuambila ne, Mukelenge wanyi, bualu bubi ebu buikale kundi; ndi nkusengelela ne, Witabushe bua muhika webe mukashi akuambile bualu mu matshu ebe, ne unvue biebe mei a muhika webe mukashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi nkusengelela ne, Mukelenge wanyi kabadi bualu bua muntu mulembakana, Nabala, mene; bualu bua bienzedi biandi bidi bu kukudimuna kua dina diandi: Nabala ndina diandi ne buhote budi nʼandi; kadi meme, muhika webe mukashi, tshiakatangila bansongalume ba mukelenge wanyi bakatumeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wanyi, bu mudi Yehowa ne muoyo ne bu mudi mutshima webe ne muoyo, bualu bua Yehowa wakakukanda bua wewe kumatshishi mashi hanshi ne bua wewe kudisombuedi ne tshianza tshiebe, nunku badi nʼebe lukuna ne badi bakeba kuenzela mukelenge wanyi bibi, bikale bu Nabala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku diha edi diakula nʼadi muhika webe mukashi kudi mukelenge wanyi difidibue kudi bansongalume badi ne mukelenge wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi nkusengelela ne, Ulekelele muhika webe mukashi dihanga diandi; Yehowa neajadike ba mu nsubu wa mukelenge wanyi bulelela, bualu bua yeye udi uluila Yehowa nvita; bualu bubi kabuena buikala kudi tô matuku ebe onso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biabika bantu bua kukulonda ne bua kukeba muoyo webe, muoyo wa mukelenge wanyi newikale musuikibue mu tshisumbu tshiotshimue ne muoyo wa Yehowa, Nzambi webe; ne mioyo ya bantu badi nʼebe lukuna, yeye neayele bu mudibo bela mabue mu tshieledi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe hashikisha Yehowa kuenzela mukelenge wanyi malu mimpe onso akamuambileye ne hakutekeye mukelenge ku mutu kua Bena Isalele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu ebu kabuena mua kunyingalasha mutshima webe, ne mutshima wa mukelenge wanyi kawena unema bujitu bualu bua mukelenge wanyi wakamatshisha mashi a bakuabo hanshi tshianana, anyi bua mukelenge wanyi wakasombuela. Henzela Yehowa mukelenge wanyi bimpe, yeye avuluke muhika wandi mukashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakambila Abigayila ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, wakukutuma kundi lelu, asankishibue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe usankishibue kabidi bua lungenyi luebe, bualu bua wewe wakunkanda lelu ne, Kumatshishi mashi a bakuabo hanshi bua meme tshidisombuedi ne tshianza tshianyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, bu mudi Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, ne muoyo, yeye nguakunkanda bua meme tshikuenzedi bibi, bu wewe kuyi mulue kundi lubilu lelu, bulelela, Nabala kakadi kushala ne tshintu, nansha muana mulume umue tô ne hatshiabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Davidi wakitabusha bintu bakalueye nʼabi kudiye mu bianza biandi; yeye wakamuambila ne, Uye biebe ku nsubu kuebe talalâ; mona, nakunvua dî diebe, nakukuitabusha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigayila wakahingana kudi Nabala; mona, yeye wakamana kulongolola bidia bia disanka mu nsubu muandi bu disanka dia mukelenge; mutshima wa Nabala wakasanka munda muandi bualu bua yeye wakatamba kukuatshika maluvu; nunku mukashi wandi kakamuambila bualu, nansha bukese nansha bunene tô ne hakatshiabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatshiabu, kukuatshika kua maluvu kua Nabala kuakashika, mukashi wandi wakamuambila malu â onso; mutshima wandi wakafua dihumpa munda muandi ne yeye wakandamuka bu dibue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahita matuku dikumi, Yehowa wakakuma Nabala, yeye wakafua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunyua Davidi ne, Nabala wakafua, yeye wakamba ne, Yehowa asankishibue bualu bua yeye wakungakuila bua bundu bunakaheta ku tshianza tshia Nabala, wakakanda muntu wandi bua yeye kenji bibi; Yehowa wakatangisha bienzedi bibi bia Nabala ha mutu handi. Davidi wakatuma bantu kudi Abigayila bua kumuangateye bu mukashi wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafika bantu ba Davidi kudi Abigayila ku Kâmele, bakamuambila ne, Davidi wakatutuma kûdi bua tuetu kubuangata bu mukashi wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakajuka, wakatua mpala wandi hanshi, wakamba ne, Monai, muntu wenu udi bu muhika bua kuowesheye makasa a bahika ba mukelenge wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigayila wakajuka lubilu, wakabanda ha nyima ha nyama wa mpunda, ne bansongakashi bandi batanu bakamulonda; yeye wakalonda bantu ba Davidi, wakalua mukashi wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakabaka Abinoama wa mu Yizelele kabidi; bubidi buabo bakadi bakashi bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakamana kufila muanʼandi mukashi, Mikala, mukashi wa Davidi, kudi Palati, muana wa Layisha wa mu Galima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.25.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
